; Blitzard: catch wild blitzlings, train a team and climb Blitzard Peak to battle its Warden.
;
; Every picture and sound in this game is made by the code itself, so there are no files to ship with it.
;
; Controls:
;   Arrow keys or W A S D   walk (hold Shift to run)
;   Enter, Space or Z       talk, read signs, confirm
;   Escape, Backspace or X  back; in the field it opens the menu, which also pauses the game
;   Menus                   Up/Down or the mouse choose, Enter/Space or a click select, Left/Right change an option
;
; Walk through tall grass, reeds or the dark cave to meet wild blitzlings. Weaken one in battle and throw a Blitz Orb
; to catch it. Tamers battle you when you walk into their line of sight. The shrine heals your team and keeps the
; blitzlings that do not fit into a team of six. Beat the Warden at the top of the peak to win.
;
; Each blitzling has an element. Ember beats Bloom, Tide beats Ember and Stone, Bloom beats Tide and Stone, Volt beats
; Tide and Gale, Stone beats Ember and Volt, and Gale beats Bloom. Moves of a blitzling's own element hit harder.
;
; The options are saved in blitzard.cfg and the game in blitzard.sav, both next to the program.

